      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bohan Hyland & Associates are delighted to present 57 Bawnville Road to market. This three bedroom end of terrace house comes to market with no onward chain providing a quick turnaround for a willing buyer and is presented in need of complete renovation throughout.\r\n\r\nThis property will appeal to first/second time buyers and investors alike and is ideally located on a quiet cul-de-sac just off the Seskin View Road close to all local amenities (shops, schools, pubs, parks, bus routes etc) and is just a short walk away from The Square Shopping Centre. The N81, N7 and M50 road networks are in close proximity.\r\n\r\nThis home briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, WC under the stairs, front aspect living room, second living space which leads to a kitchen/diner extension to the rear aspect. Upstairs we have three bedrooms and a family bathroom. To the front we have a driveway providing off street parking for two cars. Many additional benefits include double glazed windows and side entrance.\r\n\r\nTo view this property call Shane Hanevy today on 01 491 3000."
      },
